[Icon Theme]
Name=Oneshot-Cursors
Comment=Cursor theme built from OneShot's World Machine OS cursor sprites
Inherits=Adwaita

# cursors/ generated by scripts/gen_cursors.py (nix run .#gen-cursors) from
# out/the_world_machine/cursor.png — 7 pointer states + aliases. Inherits
# Adwaita so cursor names we don't have (text, wait, resize handles, ...)
# still resolve to something instead of the X11 default X.
